Smart Energy Hub - Inverters package
=====================================

This product includes Modbus register mappings derived from the following
open-source project:

  * homeassistant-solax-modbus
    Copyright (c) Wills (wills106) and contributors
    https://github.com/wills106/homeassistant-solax-modbus
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0

Specifically, the register addresses, scaling factors, and decoding logic for
Solax / Growatt / Solis / Sofar / AlphaESS / Solinteg / SRNE / Swatten inverters
are based on the maintainers' reverse-engineering work documented in the
plugin_*.py files of that project.

Smart Energy Hub re-implements the integration in a Home Assistant-independent
way, but the underlying Modbus knowledge comes from this prior art.

Modifications:
  - Removed Home Assistant entity classes (SensorEntity, NumberEntity, etc.)
  - Removed config_flow / setup logic specific to HA
  - Adapted register definitions to use Smart Energy Hub's RegisterDef format
  - Added Pydantic-style typed status objects (InverterStatus)
  - Bundled with custom Modbus client based on pymodbus

A copy of the Apache 2.0 License is included in LICENSE-APACHE-2.0.
